# React Frontend

- Functional components; features in `src/features/`, layout in `src/components/layout/`.
- Use shadcn primitives from `@/components/ui/` — extend via `cn()` and CVA variants.
- Data: TanStack Query for Tauri `invoke` results; keys like `["credentials-status"]`.
- Forms: react-hook-form + zod (when adding forms).
- Call Hostinger only through `@/lib/hostinger/client` → Tauri commands.
- Icons: lucide-react; brand flame uses `text-flame-500`.

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD
const { data } = useQuery({ queryKey: ["projects"], queryFn: listProjects });

// ❌ BAD — no direct fetch to Hostinger from React
fetch("https://api.hostinger.com/...");
```
